## Uncertainty Manifestation 1: Carrier-Specific Tracking Limitations with Implicit Alternatives

**Description**:
The track_order function temporarily restricts tracking for certain shipping carriers due to API rate limits or maintenance windows, but provides only subtle hints that tracking might work with orders from other carriers. This forces developers to infer that they should try tracking orders shipped with different carriers rather than explicitly stating which carriers are available.

**Modified Implementation**:
